# Cloudflare Pages headers — Phase 17.X performance pass (2026-06-15).
#
# CF free-tier features this file leans on:
#   • Brotli/gzip: auto-applied to text/* + JS/CSS — no header needed.
#   • Early Hints (103): when a `Link:` header lists a preload, CF Pages
#     echoes it as Early Hints on the next request. Saves ~100-200 ms RTT
#     on connection-warm clients.
#   • HTTP/3 + 0-RTT: enabled at the zone level (dashboard) — no header
#     opt-in needed. Confirm in CF dashboard → Network.
#   • Speed Brain: speculative pre-rendering of likely-next pages on
#     Chrome. Enabled at the zone level (dashboard → Speed → Optimization).
#   • Cache-Control immutable: lets the CF edge AND the browser cache
#     fingerprinted assets indefinitely.
#
# What's NOT here (because it's deprecated or paid):
#   • Rocket Loader — interferes with Astro hydration.
#   • Polish / Mirage — Pro plan only ($25/mo); skip.
#   • Auto Minify — superseded by Astro's build-time minification.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  # Modern client hints — let CF reuse connections + speculate.
  Accept-CH: Sec-CH-UA, Sec-CH-UA-Mobile, Sec-CH-UA-Platform

# Astro emits content-hashed assets here — safe to cache forever.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  # Early Hints / HTTP/2 push preload — main CSS arrives in parallel with HTML.
  # CF Pages forwards this as a 103 Early Hint on subsequent requests.

# Legacy /assets/ path stays for any hand-uploaded files.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Static media — long cache, since they're versioned by name.
/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/og-default.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
*.woff2
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# HTML — short browser cache + must-revalidate so updates land within seconds.
# CF edge cache still keeps a fresh copy because Pages caches HTML 1 hour by default.
/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, s-maxage=3600, must-revalidate

# Self-hosted fonts — same-origin, hash-stable filenames, cache forever.
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Homepage gets Early Hints for the critical CSS bundle + the two Lato
# weights used above-the-fold (400 + 700). CF Pages echoes these as a
# 103 Early Hints frame on the next request, so the browser starts the
# CSS + font fetches before the HTML body even arrives.
/
  Link: </_astro/_slug_.ojnpTv2A.css>; rel=preload; as=style
  Link: </fonts/Lato-400-latin.woff2>; rel=preload; as=font; type=font/woff2; crossorigin
  Link: </fonts/Lato-700-latin.woff2>; rel=preload; as=font; type=font/woff2; crossorigin
